# work/ is local: the English regenerated from the player's install (work/en by tools/extract.py,
# work/dbnames/todo and scope.json by tools/dbnames_scope.py), translator batches, builds and tests.
# Only our own docs and the merged-batch list are tracked; the Hebrew lives in translation/he/.
work/*
!work/TRANSLATOR.md
!work/merged.txt
!work/dbnames/
work/dbnames/*
!work/dbnames/TRANSLATOR.md
!work/dbnames/glossary.md
*.pak
*.dll
__pycache__/
target/
tools/bin/
